<p><em>Last updated: November 2026</em></p>

<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>This website belongs to {{ site.fullName }}, {{ site.jobTitle | lower }}. If you have any question about this policy, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

<h2>Information you send us</h2>
<p>The booking form on this website does <strong>not</strong> store your details. When you press "Continue on WhatsApp", your browser opens WhatsApp with a message you can review and choose to send. Anything you send through WhatsApp, phone or email is used only to respond to you, arrange your care and keep your medical records.</p>

<h2>Medical information and photos</h2>
<p>Medical details and photos you share are treated as confidential and used only for your assessment and treatment. Before-and-after photos are only ever shown publicly with the patient's written consent, and can be withdrawn on request.</p>

<h2>Cookies and third-party services</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Language switch:</strong> the Urdu translation uses Google Translate, which sets a small cookie to remember your choice.</li>
  <li><strong>Videos and maps:</strong> embedded YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, Facebook and Google Maps content may set cookies by those services when you view or play it. YouTube videos only load after you press play.</li>
  <li><strong>Social media feed:</strong> the Facebook and TikTok feeds load from those services when you scroll to them, and the Instagram feed may be delivered by Behold (behold.so), which may set their own cookies.</li>
  <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> if enabled, Google Analytics and the Meta Pixel collect anonymous information about how the site is used, to help improve it.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information held about you by contacting <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>, subject to medical record-keeping rules.</p>
